status GREEN for this lap's own work -- sow_project 28 legs 0 failing; sow_allow_reach, sow_lock, sow_reach_inputs, kyri_resins_landed, plant_liveness, fold_shelf_link_repoint, reds_ledger_headline green on metal; parity 0 differences across 8,569 digests, 9,239 tree entries and 239 symlink targets. The hot pass read 307 green of 324 with 15 red: remember_git_nib closes in this commit, instrument_refusal is half closed by my repair and half a peer's, plant_liveness closed after it caught my dead plant, and the remaining twelve stand in peer lanes -- built_tool_freshness wants rye/bootstrap.sh, and ignored_walk names two pre-existing find sites in this script that the elder carried unchanged
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the copy loop is the next and larger fall, and a copy mechanism decides the modes, symlinks and dangling targets the parity proof reads
